# Hosts that reject requests coming from data-centre IP ranges. Both open fine
# in a browser, so a CI failure here would only ever be a false positive.
^https://www\.npmjs\.com/
^https://stackoverflow\.com/

# The C# API reference lives on the gh-pages branch, but GitHub Pages serves
# the artifact uploaded by .github/workflows/pages.yml, so everything under
# /csharp/ currently returns 404. The `pages` workflow now overlays the branch
# content onto the uploaded site; remove these two lines after the first
# deployment from main that includes that change.
^https://link-foundation\.github\.io/links-notation/csharp/
